{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.12.0\n\n- #148 — Projects: the project's **saved views** drive the page: #149 views fetch + `v` / `V`, #150 Table layout (view columns, initial sort, group rows), #151 Board layout (any column field, swimlanes with `Space`), #152 Roadmap layout (timeline, `+` / `-` zoom), #153 view filter expressions evaluated locally\n- #163 — Projects: board fetches cost ~1/4 of the GraphQL points (limit-aware paging)\n- #162 — Files: content search (`/` `n` `N`) and horizontal scroll (`h` / `l`) in the preview pane\n- #168 — automatic refreshes slow down when idle or low on quota and stop under 5 % (`github-auto-refresh \"on\" | \"off\"`); instances share the board cache; the header shows `idle` / `⚠ api N left`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-08T08:57:00Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.12.0","labels":[],"number":172,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMldGmg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe PR description enumerates substantial feature work, but the diff only contains a version bump, so the release notes/PR metadata should be aligned or linked to the actual feature PRs.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the `vig` crate version to `v0.12.0` as part of the release process.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `Cargo.toml` package version from `0.11.0` to `0.12.0`.\n- Update `Cargo.lock` `vig` package entry to `0.12.0`.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate version to `0.12.0`. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Keeps the lockfile’s `vig` package version in sync with the manifest. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T08:58:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c6f86a0b6eeccf8c31eada5234bffd1582179b4d"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T09:01:27Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34207296743/job/101999695200","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:57:07Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:57:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34207296520/job/101999694727","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:57:08Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T09:07:56Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34208271126/job/102002885154","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-08T09:07:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T09:00:19Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34207296743/job/101999695096","name"